  "why": "The 24 HMC subjects in muse4_vigilance_sleep_edf (SN001-SN025, no SN014) are also in the crown HMC configs, but 13 of them sit in a different split there. Training on one config and evaluating on the other, or pooling both, leaks subjects across splits.",
